{"about":["Few are chosen. Fewer succeed.","You stumble upon a battered old book and find yourself transported to the island of Myst. As you explore the surreal landscape, you quickly learn that something has gone wrong.","Terribly wrong.","An ancient betrayal must be unveiled. Secret books concealed on the island of Myst lead the way to incredible worlds born of a master storyteller’s imagination. Yet one by one, they’re being destroyed through the treachery of his sons.","But which one?","Only your wits and imagination will serve to untangle the web of lies and deceit that shrouds the worlds of Myst.","This version of Myst features the original point-and-click gameplay style and is as close to the original 1993 version of Myst as you can get.","Remote Play allows users to connect to and play games on their PlayStation®4 or PlayStation®5 using a mobile device, PC, or another PlayStation®4 or PlayStation®5.","Software subject to license (us.playstation.com/softwarelicense)."],"shots":[{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202505/2804/d672fbec17c282bbc73b15e6b50bac6a52dec5c42a2a7353.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202505/2804/d672fbec17c282bbc73b15e6b50bac6a52dec5c42a2a7353.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202505/2804/91dee53dc692084055b8aa6c1949902139c0b87d34afc70d.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202505/2804/91dee53dc692084055b8aa6c1949902139c0b87d34afc70d.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202505/2804/47a30eecd8053f237227c2c295a6c0a88aaf57173e1bd2d0.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202505/2804/47a30eecd8053f237227c2c295a6c0a88aaf57173e1bd2d0.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202505/2804/2827266589ea35a49a9179c1b5615d485dd5aa477c94aeae.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"h